      "name": "General LTID difference equation using advance operator",
      "latex": "y[n+N]+a_1y[n+N-1]+\\cdots+a_{N-1}y[n+1]+a_Ny[n]=b_0x[n+N]+\\cdots+b_{N-1}x[n+1]+b_Nx[n]",
